<title>USA: Phoenix Duff &amp; Phelps plans shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Phoenix Duff &amp; Phelps plans shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phoenix Duff &amp; Phelps Corp said it plans to buy back up to 2 million shares of outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made from time to time in the open market or through privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Phoenix Duff &amp; Phelps is a money management firm.</p>
</text>
